cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "CXR Draft Auditor"
abstract: "A research and educational quality-assurance tool that audits a draft chest X-ray radiology impression against image-grounded findings. A fine-tuned MedGemma vision-language model extracts a constrained set of findings with bounding-box evidence from the X-ray, NVIDIA Nemotron parses the draft impression into the same label space, and a deterministic comparator flags missing findings, unsupported claims, and urgent review cases. Not a medical device and not intended for any clinical use."
authors:
